// ---- Notes ----
// - IRestRequest sends no body, so [JsonObject(MemberSerialization.OptIn)] is NOT
//   required here — that guard is for IJsonDataRequest only (see request-post).
//   [JsonIgnore] is still applied to every member so the no-body intent is explicit.
// - A null path value is skipped by the package and "{session_id}" stays literally
//   in the URL. Validate ids in the gateway, not after a 404.
// - The package does not URL-escape query values and drops empty ones; escape here.
// - Headers with an empty value are dropped, so a call made before auth simply
//   sends no Authorization header (expect a 401 -> UnityWebRequestException).
// - ApiClient strips a leading '/' and always appends a trailing '/'.
// - Routes follow captured samples, not the design doc and not the spec.
// - The template puts `using` directives inside the namespace (see any file in
//   Assets/game.shared/). Add `using System;` (Uri) and
//   `using System.Collections.Generic;` beside the framework usings, and confirm
//   order against config.example_request once one exists.
